  "changelog_v1130_opt_10": "تستخدم الصور/الفيديو/لقحات الشاشة الآن ذاكرة تخزين مؤقت على القرص: تظهر الفئات فورًا عند التشغيل دون إعادة مسح مكتبة الوسائط في كل مرة (يحل مشكلة الانتظار ~1 دقيقة على الأجهزة ذات التخزين الكبير والملفات الكثيرة).",
  "@changelog_v1130_opt_10": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_opt_11": "أصبحت أعداد الفئات دقيقة فورًا: يتم تحديث الأعداد والقوائم مباشرة بعد استعادة الذاكرة المؤقتة، دون عرض أرقام قديمة من التشغيل السابق.",
  "@changelog_v1130_opt_11": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_opt_12": "أصبح تحميل الصوت حصريًا أولًا: يُحمّل الصوت قبل الفيديو/الصور، لتجنب تنافس مكتبة الوسائط على الأجهزة الكبيرة الذي يؤدي إلى إفراغ الصوت إلى صفر.",
  "@changelog_v1130_opt_12": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_opt_13": "أصبحت ذاكرة فهرس الصوت تُكتب كتابة ذرية + فك في مؤشر منعزل: المقاطعة أثناء الكتابة لا تترك ملفًا تالفًا، والخيط الرئيسي لم يعد يعلق أو يواجه OOM مع الذاكرات الضخمة.",
  "@changelog_v1130_opt_13": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_opt_14": "تحافظ محاولات إعادة تحميل الصوت الآن على أكبر مجموعة نتائج، لمنع نتيجة جزئية (أثناء انشغال مكتبة الوسائط) من الكتابة فوق المحتوى المعروض.",
  "@changelog_v1130_opt_14": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_fix_4": "أصلحنا على الأجهزة ذات التخزين الكبير (مثل 512 جيجابايت وآلاف الملفات الوسائطية) حيث كانت فئة الصوت تُفرغ بعد التشغيل وتختفي بعد اكتمال تحميل الفيديو/الصور.",
  "@changelog_v1130_fix_4": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1130_fix_5": "أصلحنا أخطاء ترجمة بناء الإصدار (طريقة استدعاء SongModel.getMap، VideoController ليس له dispose()).",
  "@changelog_v1130_fix_5": {
    "description": "v1.1.30 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_1": "Fixed residual blank icons on category page after deleting files from browse page or other apps (new pruneDeletedMediaPaths + pruneDeletedMedia instant pruning mechanism)",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_1": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_2": "Fixed residual blank icons for non-media categories (Documents/Archives/Downloads/APKs) after delete or move in browse page",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_2": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_3": "Fixed category total size \"shows ~1 second → zeros out → reload restores\" flicker on startup",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_3": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_4": "Fixed category \"Select All\" mixing remote/local files (local page selects local only, remote page selects remote only)",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_4": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_5": "Fixed remote file deletion not refreshing the list",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_5": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_6": "Fixed image viewer residual siblingItems preview after delete, list not refreshing after 3-dot menu delete, and local delete thumbnail cache invalidation",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_6": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_7": "Fixed remote image residual thumbnail after delete, \"Show in Location\" navigating to local cache path instead of remote, and delete only removing local cache not remote original",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_7": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_8": "Fixed image viewer 3-dot menu \"Show in Location\" not navigating",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_8": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_9": "Fixed long-press batch backup APK SnackBar not showing, progress dialog stuck (multiple iterations, final solution uses rootNavigator + backupDialogOpen flag), and unable to cancel via back key",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_9": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_10": "Added \"Open Location\" button to backed-up APK popup; fixed issue requiring manual back press to see navigation (now popUntil(isFirst) then switch Tab)",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_10": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_11": "Changed batch action bar \"Clear\" button to \"Cancel\"; backup/share/uninstall buttons now use multilingual translations instead of hardcoded Chinese",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_11": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_12": "Fixed refresh button not scanning non-media files (APK not loading), corrected category branch logic and added onlyApk parameter for supplementary scan",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_12": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_13": "Simplified \"Change PIN\" entry: tap on vault home goes directly to number pad, removed redundant \"Remote Guard\" toggle and \"Lock Now\" from remote guard page",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_13": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_14": "Fixed auto-backup toggle not taking effect (new _autoSyncTriggered guard); fixed remote delete-then-backup falsely reporting success",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_14": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_15": "Fixed browse page Tab bar horizontal swipe accidentally triggering page switch (new tabBarInteracting flag + Listener protection)",
  "@changelog_v1131_fix_15": {
    "description": "v1.1.31 changelog item"
  },
  "changelog_v1131_fix_16": "Added ui_app_open_location, ui_batch_backup, ui_batch_share, ui_batch_uninstall, ui_batch_uninstall_confirm translation keys, all 10 languages covered",
  "changelog_v1132_new_1": "Wake on LAN (WOL): New entry in Drawer → Tools. Add/Edit/Delete devices (name, MAC address, broadcast address, port), send magic packets to wake devices on LAN. Device list persisted locally. Full 10-language localization.",
  "@changelog_v1132_new_1": {
    "description": "v1.1.32 changelog: changelog_v1132_new_1"
  },
  "changelog_v1132_new_2": "Image Editor: New 'Edit' button on image viewer page (top toolbar + 3-dot menu). 5 editing tabs: Adjust (brightness/contrast/saturation), Filters (original/B&W/sepia/vintage/cool/warm), Resize (exact dimensions + lock aspect ratio + 6 ID-photo presets: Passport 413×531, 1-inch 295×413, 2-inch 413×579, Small 1-inch 260×378, Large 1-inch 390×567, US Visa 600×600), Rotate & Flip (90°/180°/270° + horizontal/vertical), Crop (handle gestures + aspect ratio constraints).",
  "@changelog_v1132_new_2": {
    "description": "v1.1.32 changelog: changelog_v1132_new_2"
  },
  "changelog_v1132_new_3": "One-tap Metadata Removal: New 'Remove Metadata' option in image viewer 3-dot menu. Re-encodes image stripping EXIF/GPS/ICC metadata, saves as new file.",
  "@changelog_v1132_new_3": {
    "description": "v1.1.32 changelog: changelog_v1132_new_3"
  },
  "changelog_v1132_new_4": "Immersive Info Bar: Image viewer shows filename·dimensions·size·format on touch; Properties dialog adds Dimensions row.",
  "@changelog_v1132_new_4": {
    "description": "v1.1.32 changelog: changelog_v1132_new_4"
  },
  "changelog_v1132_fix_1": "Fixed Select All button in category page cross-selecting files from other folders when browsing by folder: Images/Videos/Audios/Screenshots/Documents/Archives/Downloads/APKs — 8 categories now only select files within the current folder when in folder view; Select All selects all files only in 'All Items' view.",
  "@changelog_v1132_fix_1": {
    "description": "v1.1.32 changelog: changelog_v1132_fix_1"
  },
  "changelog_v1132_fix_2": "Fixed Select All button failing to select files in the Screenshots folder (DCIM/Screenshots) when browsing by folder in the Images category.",
