    "description": "v1.1.34 changelog: FTP IP selection rewrite"
  },
  "changelog_v1134_fix_3": "FTP sharing now supports a custom port — configurable and persisted in settings, with live apply and auto-restart of the listener while running.",
  "@changelog_v1134_fix_3": {
    "description": "v1.1.34 changelog: FTP custom port"
  },
  "changelog_v1134_fix_4": "Fixed FTP control-port binding & PASV: the control port is now bound to the concrete LAN IP and PASV resolution is simplified, fixing connection failures behind VPN/proxy.",
  "@changelog_v1134_fix_4": {
    "description": "v1.1.34 changelog: FTP control port & PASV"
  },
  "changelog_v1134_fix_5": "Added an 'FTP server stopped' notification that replaces the previous incorrect 'port changed / not active' message when the server stops.",
